{"sourceUrl":"https://xxgcxy.gdut.edu.cn/info/1209/8531.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:51.041941+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://xxgcxy.gdut.edu.cn/info/1209/8531.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>根据广东工业大学《关于做好</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生报名推荐工作的通知》及《关于做好</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年推荐免试攻读研究生复试招收工作的通知》要求，现将我院</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生（以下简称</span><span>“推免生”）的复试招收工作办法通知如下：</span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><strong><span><span>一、招收对象</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>获得推荐免试攻读研究生资格的</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年全国高校应届本科毕业生。</span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><strong><span><span>二、招收基本条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1</span><span>、拥护党的基本路线，政治思想品德好，遵纪守法，诚实守信，学风端正，有较强的学习能力，未曾受过学校行政处分。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2</span><span>、身心健康，有足够的精力和能力完成研究生学业。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3</span><span>、学业成绩优秀，已获得本科所读高校的推免生资格。</span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><strong><span><span>三、招收专业</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1</span><span>、学术学位硕士研究生招生专业</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>080300</span><span>）光学工程</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>081000</span><span>）信息与通信工程</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2</span><span>、专业学位硕士研究生招生专业</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>085401</span><span>）新一代电子信息技术</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3</span><span>、学术学位博士研究生招生专业（招收直博生）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>081000</span><span>）信息与通信工程</span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><strong><span><span>四、招收计划</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年计划招收推免生人数以学校下达的最终招生指标为准。</span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><strong><span><span>五、复试招收工作安排</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1</span><span>、报名时间：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1</span><span>）预报名时间：</span></span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>18</span></span><span><span>日（星期</span></span><span><span>四</span></span><span><span>）晚上</span><span>24:00</span><span>截止；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>预报名方式：申请免试攻读我校</span><span>2026</span><span>年研究生均需在广东工业大学研究生（含直博生）预推免报名系统（网址：</span><span>https://ehall.gdut.edu.cn/gsapp/sys/yjsbmxsd/entrance.do</span><span>）进行网上报名（含本校推免生）（具体操作指引请见附件</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>）。申请人填写《广东工业大学</span><span>2026</span><span>年招收推荐免试攻读研究生申请表》（见附件</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>），纸质版于复试时提交。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2</span><span>）网上正式报名时间：</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>22</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>上午</span><span>9:00</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2</span><span>、计划复试时间（含预复试时间）： </span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>根据学生报名情况组织，由学院通知学生。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3</span><span>、计划复试地点：广州大学城广东工业大学工学一号馆</span><span>201</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4</span><span>、复试方案：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1</span><span>）复试方式：面试</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2</span><span>）复试内容：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>A. </span><span>专业知识（</span><span>40</span><span>分）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>B. </span><span>外语（</span><span>20</span><span>分）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>C. </span><span>综合素质（</span><span>40</span><span>分）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3</span><span>）复试成绩评定</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>复试考核小组成员根据学生的表现，给出各项成绩。学生所得的复试成绩为该考核小组成员所给成绩的平均值（满分</span><span>100</span><span>分）。复试平均成绩低于</span><span>60</span><span>分的，视为复试不合格，不予录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5</span><span>、录取原则：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1</span><span>）复试成绩计算方法</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>复试成绩</span> <span>= </span><span>专业知识 </span><span>+ </span><span>外语 </span><span>+ </span><span>综合素质</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2</span><span>）学院根据招生指标，按照复试成绩从高到低依次确定拟录取名单。</span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><strong><span><span>六、体检要求</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>所有拟录取推免生均须在二级甲等及以上公立医院进行体检，于</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年</span><span>10</span><span>月</span><span>30</span><span>日以前将体检报告送交拟录取学院，学院汇总后报送研究生院。体检标准参照教育部、原卫生部、中国残联印发的《普通高等学校招生体检工作指导意见》（教学〔</span><span>2003</span><span>〕</span><span>3</span><span>号）要求，按照《教育部办公厅卫生部办公厅关于普通高等学校招生学生入学身体检查取消乙肝项目检测有关问题的通知》（教学厅〔</span><span>2010</span><span>〕</span><span>2</span><span>号）规定执行。不参加体检或体检不合格者不予录取。新生入学后将进行体检复查，若有弄虚作假，将撤销入学资格。</span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span>信息工程学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"a9c1dc6fb51cb65a600bee091b18210dc71751313c49109375fb538b4a289f6f","textLength":1217,"sourceSha256":"1087857218cfe5c960bea389dd66550cb58a61d165fc26181becbf6ce0e35cfe","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"附件1.广东工业大学2026年接收推免生预报名操作指引.docx","url":"https://xxgcxy.gdut.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1839985821&wbfileid=213804F42A0130CD35390CA2D43AB202"},{"name":"附件2.广东工业大学2026年招收推荐免试攻读研究生申请表.doc","url":"https://xxgcxy.gdut.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1839985821&wbfileid=7D827228CB7D79F783315B94CBCCD861"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-b06d80ebd8634a4ffc53","title":"2025年广东工业大学信息工程学院2026年推荐免试攻读研究生复试招收工作办法","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:51.041941+00:00"}
